window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A misfit dwarf. An ancient destiny. One epic battle for two worlds.</b></p> <p>Val Stonehold never fit in with other Iron Dwarves. At nearly six feet tall and struggling with her identity, she carved out a life for herself in New York City as a bodyguard and blacksmith.</p> <p>When an ancient power awakens within her, Val discovers she's more than just an outsider. She's a Warrior of the Red Bear, sworn to protect the Lunar Fae and all of paranormal-kind.</p> <p><b>Dark forces threaten both Earth and Avalon.</b></p> <p>Val must master her berserker rage and iron magic to stop a rebellion that could unleash chaos across dimensions. With a ragtag team of paranormal misfits at her side, Val races to build a sanctuary for her people while battling ancient evils.</p> <p><i>But time is running out.</i></p> <p>Can Val embrace her true nature and save both worlds? Or will her insecurities doom them all to darkness?</p>"; 
